---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from "../../i18n/utils";
import { SmallForm } from "../../components/SmallForm";
import photo from "../../assets/imagess/payment-gateway.jpg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

const theLang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(theLang as "en" | "es");
---

<Layout
  title="Payment Gateway"
  description={`Our
    payment gateway configuration service is designed to provide a
    seamless shopping experience for your customers while maximizing the
    security and efficiency of your transactions.`}
>
  <h1
    class="w-full py-5 laptop:py-8 bg-blue text-[22px] tablet:text-[26px] laptop:text-3xl
font-extrabold text-center text-white"
  >
    Payment Gateway
  </h1>
  <main
    class="flex flex-col w-full py-14 px-[5%] full:px-[15%] min-[1400px]:px-[20%] gap-10"
  >
    <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl laptop:text-5xl font-bold">Payment Gateway</h2>
      <p class="text-left">
        At PCAPPSINT LLC, we understand that an efficient and secure payment
        gateway is essential for the success of your online business. Our
        payment gateway configuration service is designed to provide a seamless <strong
          >shopping experience for your customers</strong
        > while maximizing the <strong>security</strong> and <strong
          >efficiency</strong
        > of your transactions.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={photo} alt={"Service Image"} class={`w-full rounded-lg`} />
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold pt-6">What Does It Involve?</h3>
    <ol
      class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 list-inside list-decimal text-justify marker:text-xl marker:font-semibold"
    >
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Customized Integration:</span>
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            We tailor the payment gateway to the specific needs of your
            business. Whether you need integration with multiple payment methods
            or advanced functionalities like recurring subscriptions, our
            experts handle everything.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Superior Security:</span>
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            Protect your customers' data with the most advanced security
            measures. We implement encryption technologies and comply with
            standards to ensure that every transaction is safe and reliable.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Optimized User Experience:</span>
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            We provide a frictionless shopping experience for your customers,
            which can reduce cart abandonment and increase conversions. With an
            intuitive and fast payment interface, your customers can complete
            their purchases with ease.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Multichannel Support:</span>
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            Integrate your payment gateway not only on your website but also on
            mobile apps and other sales channels. This ensures a consistent and
            convenient payment experience for your customers, no matter how they
            choose to shop.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl"
          >Real-Time Monitoring and Analytics:</span
        >
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            Keep control over your transactions with real-time monitoring and
            analytics tools. This allows you to make informed decisions and
            continuously optimize your payment processes to improve efficiency
            and profitability.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Specialized Technical Support:</span
        >
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            Our support team is available to assist you at every step of the
            process, from initial setup to resolving any issues that may arise.
            We ensure that your payment gateway operates smoothly and is always
            operational.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-semibold text-xl">Scalability and Flexibility:</span>
        <ul class="pl-6 laptop:pl-12 py-4 flex flex-col">
          <li>
            As your business grows, your payment gateway should grow with you.
            Our solutions are scalable and flexible, allowing you to add new
            functionalities and adapt to your business’s changing needs without
            complications.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <!--     <section
      class="bg-sectionBg w-full min-[1500px]:min-w-[800px] full:min-w-[460px] flex flex-col items-center gap-8 px-4 tablet:px-4
  laptop:px-8 py-12"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-center">
          {t("nav.contactBtn")}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-center">{t("contact.formText")}</p>
      </div>
      <SmallForm lang={theLang} client:only />
    </section> -->
  </main>
</Layout>
